a data-file inventory in SLPI stage 1: bergamotaslpi=1 lists /persist/sensors/*, the vendor sensor config JSONs, sns_reg_config and the /dsp
files with sizes (bergamotaslpifs=0 skips it). Partitions are found by name through bergamota_ufs_read_part(); nothing is ever written.
Requires 1137, 1140.

